 "reference_27B_matched_text_tower": {
  "i2t_r@1": 0.433,
  "source": "artifacts/nla/q4/browser_text_tower.json interpretation.claim: matched Qwen3.8-27B text tower on identical images at identical training scale"
 },
 "caveats": [
  "mpnet, gte-base, e5-base, bge-small and all-MiniLM-L6-v2 were trained on sentence-pair corpora that include COCO caption TEXT (caption-caption pairs), so they arrive with caption-shaped geometry; they never saw these images, their states, or the pairing. embed-table (Qwen3-0.6B input embedding table, mean-pooled) and hash-bow have no such exposure and are the clean rungs.",
  "single fixed split (images 0-3999 fit, 4000-4999 score); three head-init seeds (0,1,2), reported as mean with [min,max]. Seed range on i2t R@1 is 0.01-0.03 for every rung, so the ordering sentence-encoders > 27B text tower (0.433) > embed-table > 0.6B reference (0.356) > hash-bow is outside seed noise.",
  "e5-base, gte-base and mpnet (110M each) land at 0.52-0.53 i2t R@1: a ceiling for this head/recipe that three different 110M encoders share; bge-small (33M) 0.50; MiniLM (22M) 0.47. The 27B text tower at 0.433 sits below all five.",
  "i2t is scored over 1,000 images against 5,001 captions; chance R@1 is 0.0002 and every shuffled control sits at 0.000 to 0.002 with median rank 748 to 1043."
 ]
